# Pairs with EveryCommitEventuallyCovered. Without the background re-publish a
# write whose publication failed is never covered, so peers may trust their old
# snapshot indefinitely.
MODULE: RetryAdvanceNeverRuns
TARGET: EveryCommitEventuallyCovered
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the background loop never re-publishes an owed advance
PERTURBS: RetryAdvance
BOUNDS: NumSilos = 1, MaxFailures = 1

--- FIND
    /\ wstate = "failed" /\ alive[wsilo] /\ owes[wsilo]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the loop never runs.
    /\ FALSE /\ wstate = "failed" /\ alive[wsilo] /\ owes[wsilo]
--- END
